// 本文件装配消息中心的实时总线：单节点使用进程内 Hub，多节点使用 Redis Pub/Sub，并用 asynq 为失败的广播提供持久重试。
// This file wires the message-centre realtime bus: a single node uses the in-process hub, multiple nodes use Redis
// Pub/Sub, and asynq provides durable retries for failed broadcasts.

package service

import (
	"{{ .YdModule }}/core/config"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/core/logx"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging/realtime"
{{- if .Redis }}
	"context"
	"os"
	"strconv"
	"strings"
	"time"

	"{{ .YdModule }}/data/redisx"
{{- end }}
{{- if and .Redis .Asynq }}
	"{{ .YdModule }}/core/jsonx"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/messaging"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/data/asynqx"
	"github.com/hibiken/asynq"
{{- end }}
)

// 消息总线配置键：node_id 让运维在多副本部署中固定节点标识；留空时按主机名与进程号生成。
// Message bus configuration key: node_id lets operations pin a node identity in a multi-replica deployment; when empty
// it is derived from the hostname and process id.
const configMessageNodeID = "message.node_id"

{{- if and .Redis .Asynq }}
// messageEventTask is the durable broadcast task type. | messageEventTask 是持久广播任务类型。
const messageEventTask = "yd:message:event"
{{- end }}

// NewMessageBus assembles the realtime hub.
// NewMessageBus 装配实时 Hub。
//
// A project without a redis section gets the in-process hub and needs no infrastructure. A project
// with redis gets Redis Pub/Sub and therefore cross-node delivery. When asynq is also enabled, a
// failed Pub/Sub write is enqueued and republished by whichever node processes the task. A failed
// Redis connection never blocks startup: the local hub keeps working and the failure is logged. |
// 未配置 redis 的项目拿到进程内 Hub，不需要任何基础设施。配置了 redis 的项目得到 Redis Pub/Sub，
// 因而具备跨节点投递。同时启用 asynq 时，Pub/Sub 写入失败会入队，并由处理该任务的任一节点重发。
// Redis 连接失败绝不阻塞启动：本地 Hub 继续工作，失败只记录日志。
func NewMessageBus(cfg *config.Config, log *logx.Logger) (*realtime.Hub, func() error, error) {
	if log == nil {
		log = logx.Default()
	}
{{- if .Redis }}
	redisClient, err := redisx.Open(redisx.OptionsFromConfig(cfg))
	if err != nil {
		log.Warn("redis is configured but unavailable, message delivery stays local | 已配置 redis 但不可用，消息投递保持本地",
			logx.Err(err),
		)
		return realtime.New(log), func() error { return nil }, nil
	}
	// 启动时做一次有界探测：Redis 不可达就明确退回单节点，而不是让订阅协程每秒重试并刷日志。
	// A bounded probe at startup: an unreachable Redis degrades explicitly to single-node instead of letting the
	// subscription goroutine retry and flood the log every second.
	healthCtx, healthCancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 2*time.Second)
	healthErr := redisx.Health(healthCtx, redisClient)
	healthCancel()
	if healthErr != nil {
		_ = redisx.Close(redisClient)
		log.Warn("redis health check failed, message delivery stays local | Redis 健康检查失败，消息投递保持本地",
			logx.Err(healthErr),
		)
		return realtime.New(log), func() error { return nil }, nil
	}
	bus, err := realtime.NewRedisBus(redisClient, realtime.DefaultRedisChannel, log)
	if err != nil {
		_ = redisx.Close(redisClient)
		log.Warn("message bus is unavailable, delivery stays local | 消息总线不可用，投递保持本地", logx.Err(err))
		return realtime.New(log), func() error { return nil }, nil
	}
	nodeID := nodeIdentity(cfg)
	var retry realtime.RetryQueue
{{- if .Asynq }}
	var (
		taskSrv *asynqx.Server
		taskCli *asynqx.Client
	)
{{- end }}
{{- if .Asynq }}
	registry := asynqx.NewRegistry()
	registry.Register(messageEventTask, func(ctx context.Context, payload asynqx.Payload) error {
		raw, marshalErr := jsonx.Marshal(payload)
		if marshalErr != nil {
			return marshalErr
		}
		var event messaging.Event
		if unmarshalErr := jsonx.Unmarshal(raw, &event); unmarshalErr != nil {
			return unmarshalErr
		}
		return bus.Publish(ctx, event)
	})
	if regErr := registry.Err(); regErr != nil {
		log.Warn("message retry task registry is invalid | 消息重试任务注册表非法", logx.Err(regErr))
	} else {
		options := asynqx.OptionsFromConfig(cfg)
		redisOpt := asynq.RedisClientOpt{
			Addr:     strings.TrimSpace(cfg.GetString("redis.addr")),
			Password: cfg.GetString("redis.password"),
			DB:       cfg.GetInt("redis.db"),
		}
		if options.RedisAddr == "" {
			options.RedisAddr = redisOpt.Addr
		}
		client, clientErr := asynqx.NewClient(redisOpt, options)
		if clientErr != nil {
			log.Warn("message retry client is unavailable | 消息重试客户端不可用", logx.Err(clientErr))
		} else {
			server := asynqx.NewServer(registry, redisOpt, options, log)
			if startErr := server.Start(); startErr != nil {
				log.Warn("message retry worker is unavailable | 消息重试工作器不可用", logx.Err(startErr))
				_ = client.Close()
			} else {
				taskCli = client
				taskSrv = server
				retry = &asynqRetryQueue{client: client}
			}
		}
	}
{{- end }}
	hub := realtime.NewDistributed(log, bus, retry, nodeID)
	log.Info("message bus is ready | 消息总线已就绪",
		logx.Str("node", nodeID),
		logx.Str("channel", realtime.DefaultRedisChannel),
		logx.Bool("durable_retry", retry != nil),
	)
	return hub, func() error {
		hub.Close()
{{- if .Asynq }}
		if taskSrv != nil {
			taskSrv.Shutdown()
		}
		if taskCli != nil {
			if closeErr := taskCli.Close(); closeErr != nil {
				log.Warn("message retry client close failed | 消息重试客户端关闭失败", logx.Err(closeErr))
			}
		}
{{- end }}
		return redisx.Close(redisClient)
	}, nil
{{- else }}
	// 没有 Redis 时没有跨节点能力：这是单节点部署的正常形态，而不是故障。
	// Without Redis there is no cross-node delivery: that is the normal single-node shape, not a fault.
	log.Info("message delivery is local to this process | 消息投递仅限本进程")
	return realtime.New(log), func() error { return nil }, nil
{{- end }}
}

{{- if .Redis }}

// nodeIdentity returns the configured node id or a stable per-process fallback. | nodeIdentity 返回配置的节点 ID，
// 缺失时返回按进程推导的稳定回退值。
func nodeIdentity(cfg *config.Config) string {
	if cfg != nil {
		if value := strings.TrimSpace(cfg.GetString(configMessageNodeID)); value != "" {
			return value
		}
	}
	host, err := os.Hostname()
	if err != nil || strings.TrimSpace(host) == "" {
		host = "node"
	}
	return host + "-" + strconv.Itoa(os.Getpid())
}
{{- end }}

{{- if and .Redis .Asynq }}

// asynqRetryQueue republishes failed broadcasts through the task queue. | asynqRetryQueue 通过任务队列重发失败的广播。
type asynqRetryQueue struct {
	// client enqueues the durable task. | client 入队持久任务。
	client *asynqx.Client
}

// Enqueue stores one event for a later republish. | Enqueue 保存一条事件供稍后重发。
func (q *asynqRetryQueue) Enqueue(ctx context.Context, event messaging.Event) error {
	if q == nil || q.client == nil {
		return nil
	}
	// The request context is cancelled once the response is written, so the enqueue uses its own short-lived context.
	// 请求上下文在响应结束后会被取消，入队必须使用自己的短超时上下文。
	enqueueCtx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 5*time.Second)
	defer cancel()
	_, err := q.client.Enqueue(enqueueCtx, messageEventTask, event)
	if err != nil {
		return err
	}
	_ = ctx
	return nil
}
{{- end }}
